
  [1mB. Separate browser global [38;5;153mtracking.js[0m — new top-level file, loaded by a second [38;5;153m<script>[39m tag before [38;5;153mapp.js[39m. Same
  functions, isolated file.
  [3mBuys:[0m clear boundary; [38;5;153mapp.js[39m goes back to being about the form. Cheap.
  [3mCosts:[0m load-order coupling in [38;5;153mindex.html[39m (silent breakage if the tags are reordered), and still no way to test — a
